title: A Decision of the War
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_war.svg

= [+ wd_heading +]

[? if wc_lobby_failed : Our lobbying fails. The War Council will [+ wc_plan_text +]. ?][? if not wc_lobby_failed : The War Council will [+ wc_plan_text +]. ?]

[? if wd_has : [+ wd_text +] ?]

[? if wd_has and not wc_command : The Chancellor's people mean to *[+ wd_def_label +]*. If the Caucus wants otherwise, it will have to carry the Senate. ?]

- @opt_a: [+ wd_a_label +]
- @opt_b: [+ wd_b_label +]
- @no_dilemma: Continue.

@opt_a
view-if: wd_has
subtitle: [+ wd_a_sub +]
on-arrival: {! SW.dilemmaResolve(Q, 'a'); !}
go-to: war_dilemma_result

@opt_b
view-if: wd_has
subtitle: [+ wd_b_sub +]
on-arrival: {! SW.dilemmaResolve(Q, 'b'); !}
go-to: war_dilemma_result

@no_dilemma
view-if: not wd_has

The orders go out, and the fleets move.

@war_dilemma_result

